y": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "① 用户表达与 AI 拆解\n全局要求 + 房间具体诉求\n识别歧义、遗漏与需要确认的维度", "originalText": "① 用户表达与 AI 拆解\n全局要求 + 房间具体诉求\n识别歧义、遗漏与需要确认的维度", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "ask", "type": "rectangle", "x": 700, "y": 180, "width": 530, "height": 145, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ask-text", "type": "text", "x": 722, "y": 194, "width": 486, "height": 121, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "② 对话后给选择题\n优先询问会改变项目或方案的条件\n支持自由补充与暂不确定", "originalText": "② 对话后给选择题\n优先询问会改变项目或方案的条件\n支持自由补充与暂不确定", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "stop", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1340, "y": 180, "width": 530, "height": 176, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "stop-text", "type": "text", "x": 1362, "y": 194, "width": 486, "height": 152, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "③ 判断是否可以结束追问\n关键维度已答、无未处理冲突\n未知项明确标成待现场确认\n用户可以查看摘要并确认", "originalText": "③ 判断是否可以结束追问\n关键维度已答、无未处理冲突\n未知项明确标成待现场确认\n用户可以查看摘要并确认", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "doc", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1340, "y": 440, "width": 530, "height": 145, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "doc-text", "type": "text", "x": 1362, "y": 454, "width": 486, "height": 121, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "④ 用户确认需求文档\n每条需求有编号、区域、优先级\n保存依据、待确认事项和版本", "originalText": "④ 用户确认需求文档\n每条需求有编号、区域、优先级\n保存依据、待确认事项和版本", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "proposal", "type": "rectangle", "x": 700, "y": 440, "width": 530, "height": 145, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "proposal-text", "type": "text", "x": 722, "y": 454, "width": 486, "height": 121, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "⑤ 商家制作并上传方案\n施工项目、材料、工艺及点位\n对齐需求编号，标明待勘测信息", "originalText": "⑤ 商家制作并上传方案\n施工项目、材料、工艺及点位\n对齐需求编号，标明待勘测信息", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "review", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 440, "width": 530, "height": 176, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "review-text", "type": "text", "x": 82, "y": 454, "width": 486, "height": 152, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "⑥ AI 审查并同步解释\n有证据满足 / 有偏差 / 信息不足\n检查遗漏、冲突、重复及新增理由\n给出方案原文依据与具体问题", "originalText": "⑥ AI 审查并同步解释\n有证据满足 / 有偏差 / 信息不足\n检查遗漏、冲突、重复及新增理由\n给出方案原文依据与具体问题", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "issue", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 720, "width": 530, "height": 176, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "issue-text", "type": "text", "x": 82, "y": 734, "width": 486, "height": 152, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "⑦ 有偏差或信息不足\n商家收到逐项问题清单\n修改方案 / 补证 / 提出无法满足\n说明新版改了什么及为什么", "originalText": "⑦ 有偏差或信息不足\n商家收到逐项问题清单\n修改方案 / 补证 / 提出无法满足\n说明新版改了什么及为什么", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "resolve", "type": "rectangle", "x": 700, "y": 720, "width": 530, "height": 176, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "resolve-text", "type": "text", "x": 722, "y": 734, "width": 486, "height": 152, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "⑧ 处理分歧（补充出口）\n已解决 → 复查新版\n待勘测 → 保留未决事项\n需取舍 → 用户调整需求或选方案", "originalText": "⑧ 处理分歧（补充出口）\n已解决 → 复查新版\n待勘测 → 保留未决事项\n需取舍 → 用户调整需求或选方案", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "confirm", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1340, "y": 720, "width": 530, "height": 176, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "confirm-text", "type": "text", "x": 1362, "y": 734, "width": 486, "height": 152, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "⑨ 用户理解并最终确认\n通俗解释专业术语和材料差异\n3D 展示对应区域、点位及效果\n保存需求、方案与确认记录", "originalText": "⑨ 用户理解并最终确认\n通俗解释专业术语和材料差异\n3D 展示对应区域、点位及效果\n保存需求、方案与确认记录", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "recheck", "type": "rectangle", "x": 700, "y": 995, "width": 530, "height": 145, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "recheck-text", "type": "text", "x": 722, "y": 1009, "width": 486, "height": 121, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "修订后复查（补充规则）\n复查问题是否解决及是否影响其他项\n需求改变时更新基准，再对照方案", "originalText": "修订后复查（补充规则）\n复查问题是否解决及是否影响其他项\n需求改变时更新基准，再对照方案", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "learn", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1260, "width": 530, "height": 176, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "learn-text", "type": "text", "x": 82, "y": 1274, "width": 486, "height": 152, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "日新 · 收集已核实纠正\n记录漏问、漏检、误报及纠正依据\n用户或专业方确认后进入经验库\n一次反馈对应明确的适用条件", "originalText": "日新 · 收集已核实纠正\n记录漏问、漏检、误报及纠正依据\n用户或专业方确认后进入经验库\n一次反馈对应明确的适用条件", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "version", "type": "rectangle", "x": 700, "y": 1260, "width": 530, "height": 176, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "version-text", "type": "text", "x": 722, "y": 1274, "width": 486, "height": 152, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "日新 · 生成规则新版本\n更新追问策略、工项对应与审查规则\n预留案例比较旧版与新版\n记录来源、验证结果，支持回退", "originalText": "日新 · 生成规则新版本\n更新追问策略、工项对应与审查规则\n预留案例比较旧版与新版\n记录来源、验证结果，支持回退", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "evaluate", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1340, "y": 1260, "width": 530, "height": 176, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#b6cabb", "backgroundColor": "#eaf2ec", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "evaluate-text", "type": "text", "x": 1362, "y": 1274, "width": 486, "height": 152, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "日新 · 第二次运行验证\n用未参与学习的需求或方案测试\n比较遗漏数、误报数、人工纠正次数\n展示学到了什么及适用范围", "originalText": "日新 · 第二次运行验证\n用未参与学习的需求或方案测试\n比较遗漏数、误报数、人工纠正次数\n展示学到了什么及适用范围", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}, {"id": "notes", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 1500, "width": 1810, "height": 125, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7d2b5", "backgroundColor": "#edf1e7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "notes-text", "type": "text", "x": 82, "y": 1514, "width": 1766, "height": 101, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#233b35", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 17, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "text": "闭环说明\n关键信息不足时返回②补问；商家修订后经过复查再进入⑥；审查已有充分依据时进入⑨。\n解释和 3D 查看可在审查中使用。追问轮数取决于待确认事项，结束前需用户确认需求摘要。", "originalText": "闭环说明\n关键信息不足时返回②补问；商家修订后经过复查再进入⑥；审查已有充分依据时进入⑨。\n解释和 3D 查看可在审查中使用。追问轮数取决于待确认事项，结束前需用户确认需求摘要。", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.4}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#f7f8f5", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}